{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t財政司副司長兼署理房屋局局長黃偉綸表示，有信心透過制度改革，新成立的公營房屋樓宇管制組能夠改變部門文化及處理投訴的工作。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n同場出席本台節目的發展局局長甯漢豪表示，樓宇維修顧問和承建商「預審名單」，共收到約650宗申請，反應令人鼓舞。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.325065+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:45:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:27.099201+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:27.596686+00:00","content_hash":"dfd2db6ebe9115e0ab29177fbcc641267985768105f2f36aaa7d411f0730f54f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}